<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chase Manhattan lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chase Manhattan lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said Monday it had lowered its rating on Chase Manhattan Corp to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>It also said it had cut its rating on the group of money center banks to market perform from overweight.  </p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Chase was trading off 1-3/4 at 98-1/2.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk 212-859-1730))</p>
